# Simple flowshop: 2 machines, 3 conveyors, one of each resource.
# Format: first row the conveyors, first column the machines. Name*n: the
# factory owns n of them (1 without *n). A name holding a "," a "*" or a
# "#" is written between double quotes: "C*1"*2.
# Cells: processing time of the conveyor on the machine, in the time unit
# of the net. Empty: the conveyor does not visit the machine.
# Every part visits the machines from top to bottom, every machine works
# on the conveyors from left to right.
machine\conveyor,C1,C2,C3
M1,2.0,3.0,1.0
M2,1.0,2.0,1.5
